## Browser Support


Axios and Fetch are widely supported among modern browsers. For older environments like IE 11 that doesn’t support[ES6 Promises](https://caniuse.com/promises) , we have to[use a polyfill](https://github.com/stefanpenner/es6-promise) . Also for Fetch, specifically, we will add[another polyfill](https://github.com/github/fetch) to support implementations in[older browsers](https://caniuse.com/fetch) .


## Conclusion


In this guide, we discussed Fetch and axios and practically compare them using real-world scenarios. In the end, what you select in your project depends on your personal preference and ease of use.


